[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4757101551","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120463#issuecomment-4757101551","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120463","id":4757101551,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG4ub7w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-20T09:08:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T09:08:44Z","body":"Please see the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node2d.html#class-node2d-property-scale)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4757101551/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762010261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120463#issuecomment-4762010261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120463","id":4762010261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG9aClQ","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T12:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T12:42:42Z","body":"As mentioned by @AThousandShips , the scale documentation notes this is expected behaviour with negative x scales. If you are just trying to flip the sprite as you move backwards, [`Sprite2D.flip_h`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_sprite2d.html#class-sprite2d-property-flip-h) is probably the better option.\n\nFor the general issue of scale with Physics bodies, see [Troubleshooting physics issues: Scaled physics bodies or collision shapes do not collide correctly](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/physics/troubleshooting_physics_issues.html#scaled-physics-bodies-or-collision-shapes-do-not-collide-correctly). You will need to use other means like the suggestions in that troubleshooting section if you want to achieve similar effects.\n\nClosing due to being intended behaviour.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762010261/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765063360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120463#issuecomment-4765063360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120463","id":4765063360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHAUYwA","user":{"login":"zongo811","id":77285389,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3Mjg1Mzg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77285389?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811","html_url":"https://github.com/zongo811","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zongo811/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T05:03:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T05:03:32Z","body":"@CreatedBySeb \nThank you for quick and helpful answer. I confess I did not checked this part of the documentation for Node2D. But on reading it I don't understand it either and dumb it down for myself to \"sorry, this does not work\".\nThat's okay ;)\n\nThe part about troubleshooting is rather helpful, thanks for pointing this out.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765063360/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4767483105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120463#issuecomment-4767483105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120463","id":4767483105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHCoE4Q","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T10:49:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T10:49:40Z","body":"@zongo811 No worries, essentially properties like `scale`, `rotation` and `position` are mapped on to a transformation matrix which is used for calculations ([`Transform2D`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_transform2d.html#class-transform2d)). What the `scale` docs are saying is that because of how scale is encoded in this transform, a negative x-scale cannot be extracted back out as it is equivalent to a different interpretation which is prioritised (probably since it is more common).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4767483105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]